SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] rest — Race day as planned — keep warm-up to 10 m
 in easy jog plus 3
DESCRIPTION:Race day as planned — keep warm-up to 10 min easy jog plus 3
 –4 strides only\; target 5:45–5:50/km and do not go out faster than 5:
 40/km in the first kilometre\; cool-down walk 10–15 min post-finish.\n\n
 Reason: With only one run logged in 4 weeks and chronic sleep deficit\, a 
 conservative early pace protects against blow-up given the limited run-spe
 cific conditioning.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
