SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Drop the AI-added run session entirely on
  Oct 13 — keep the 
DESCRIPTION:Drop the AI-added run session entirely on Oct 13 — keep the p
 ool swim (2km\, technique focus) and reduce the cycling spin to 45 min at 
 Z1 (<128W) only\; three sessions on day 3 post-race is too much.\n\nReason
 : Stacking a run\, bike\, and swim three days after a race with pre-existi
 ng sleep debt risks compounding fatigue rather than allowing true recovery
 .\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
