SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with a steady aerobic run of 35
 –40 min at 6:30–7:00/
DESCRIPTION:Replace with a steady aerobic run of 35–40 min at 6:30–7:00
 /km — no intervals this session\; save intensity for the following week 
 once post-race recovery is confirmed.\n\nReason: Only 5 days post-race wit
 h a very thin recent run base\, high-intensity 800m intervals carry meanin
 gful injury and overreach risk before fitness has been re-established.\n\n
 AI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
