SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Cap at 10–11 km at 6:45–7:00/km (~70
 –75 min) — build conserv
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 10–11 km at 6:45–7:00/km (~70–75 min) — build co
 nservatively back to long-run distance over 2–3 weeks rather than jumpin
 g straight to 13 km on the first long run back.\n\nReason: With only one r
 un in the past 4 weeks and post-race fatigue\, jumping to 13–14 km risks
  soft-tissue overload\; 10–11 km is a safer starting point to rebuild ae
 robic run base.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
