SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Race as planned — arrive 45 min early\
 , do a 400–600m warm-up
DESCRIPTION:Race as planned — arrive 45 min early\, do a 400–600m warm-
 up swim if conditions allow\, seed conservatively in the first 500m to avo
 id blowing up\, and target a negative-split effort across the 5km.\n\nReas
 on: Given recent open water sessions of 5.2 km (153 min) and 2.0 km (63 mi
 n)\, the distance is within reach but pacing strategy is critical — star
 ting conservatively will produce a better overall time given the athlete's
  aerobic swim base.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
